  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/654/654-6.htm",
  "statuteText": "654:6 Disqualification for Bribery or Intimidation. –\n\nAny person convicted of bribery or intimidation relating to elections under RSA 659:40 shall thereafter be forever disqualified from exercising the right to vote, except that the supreme court may, on notice to the attorney general, restore the privileges of a voter to any person who may have forfeited them by conviction of such offenses."
}
